    "homepage": {
      "status": 200,
      "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Privacy Policy — NRE Systems</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"How NRE Systems handles data, what we collect, and how you can opt out of personalised advertising.\" />\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"assets/img/logo-mark.svg\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300..700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/css/style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"NRE Systems home\">\n      <span class=\"logo__mark\"></span>\n      <span class=\"logo__word\">NRE <em>Systems</em></span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"site-nav\">\n      <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"is-active\">Privacy</a>\n      <a href=\"optout.html\">Opt-out</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"main\">\n    <article class=\"legal\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Privacy</span>\n      <h1 class=\"legal__title\">Privacy <em>Policy</em></h1>\n      <span class=\"legal__updated\">Effective · 12 January 2026</span>\n      <p class=\"legal__intro\">\n        NRE Systems respects the privacy of the people who encounter our\n        infrastructure. This document explains, in plain terms, what\n        information we process, what we do not, how we share it, and how\n        you can opt out. We keep it short on purpose.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"legal__body\">\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">01</span>Who we are</h2>\n        <p>\n          NRE Systems operates the advertising and measurement infrastructure\n          reachable through nresystems.com and our partner placements. We\n          review this Policy regularly and may update it by publishing a new\n          version on this page — the date at the top of the page always\n          reflects the most recent revision.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">02</span>What we do not collect</h2>\n        <p>\n          We do not collect personally identifiable information (\"PII\")\n          through our services. PII includes things like your name, home\n          address, phone number or email address. Our platform is\n          identity-free by design.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">03</span>What we do collect</h2>\n        <p>\n          We offer services that help advertisers and publishers show\n          relevant content to the right audience. To make that possible, we\n          process non-personally identifiable information (\"Non-PII\") about\n          how people interact with ads, placements and pages served through\n          our network. Non-PII typically includes:\n        </p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Browser type, version and language</li>\n          <li>Operating system and device category</li>\n          <li>The domain of the website being visited</li>\n          <li>The page on which an ad is shown</li>\n          <li>Approximate geolocation at country or region level</li>\n          <li>Anonymous identifiers used to deduplicate and frequency-cap</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>\n          This Non-PII is collected using cookies, pixels and similar\n          technologies. A cookie is a small file placed on your browser; a\n          pixel is a short piece of code used by a website or ad server to\n          register an interaction. Neither is tied to your real-world\n          identity.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          Cookies set by our partners, service providers or third-party\n          analytics vendors are covered by their own privacy notices. We do\n          not control those cookies and have no access to the data they\n          collect beyond what those partners choose to share with us.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">04</span>How we share information</h2>\n        <p>\n          Because we do not collect PII through our services, we do not\n          sell, rent or share PII with third parties for their own purposes.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          We may share the Non-PII we collect, and data derived from it,\n          with our customers so that they can run measurement, optimise\n          campaigns and deliver more relevant creative to the right audience\n          segments. Information shared in this way cannot be used to\n          identify any individual person. Every customer is contractually\n          required to use the data they receive in compliance with\n          applicable law.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          We may also disclose information to competent authorities where\n          we reasonably believe we are obligated to do so by law, or in\n          order to investigate, prevent or act on suspected fraud, abuse or\n          threats to the safety of any person.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">05</span>Your choices</h2>\n        <p>\n          Cookies and similar technologies let us and our partners deliver\n          a more relevant experience, but you are always in control.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          You can configure your browser to refuse all cookies or to remove\n          cookies that have already been stored. The exact controls depend\n          on your browser — most publish step-by-step instructions in their\n          help documentation. Blocking cookies may prevent some websites\n          from working as intended.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          You can also opt out of interest-based advertising delivered\n          through NRE Systems by visiting our <a href=\"optout.html\">opt-out page</a>.\n          The opt-out preference is stored as a signal in your browser and\n          remains valid for up to two years. If you clear your browser\n          storage, switch devices or change browsers, you will need to opt\n          out again.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">06</span>Data security</h2>\n        <p>\n          We follow generally accepted industry practices to protect data\n          against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure and\n          destruction. That includes technical, physical and organisational\n          measures appropriate to the risk of processing. Data held on our\n          systems is treated as confidential. No method of transmission\n          over the internet is ever fully secure, so while we work hard to\n          protect information at all times, we cannot guarantee absolute\n          security.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">07</span>Children</h2>\n        <p>\n          Our services, products and websites are not directed at children.\n          We do not knowingly collect any information from anyone under the\n          age of sixteen. If you believe a child has provided us with\n          personal information, please contact\n          <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ee9d9b9e9e819c9aae809c8b9d979d9a8b839dc08d8183\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"acdfd9dcdcc3ded8ecc2dec9dfd5dfd8c9c1df82cfc3c1\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>\n          and we will remove it.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">08</span>Links to other sites</h2>\n        <p>\n          Our website and our ad placements may link to third-party\n          websites. A link does not mean we endorse the destination. We do\n          not control the content or privacy practices of the sites we\n          link to, and you should review their own privacy notices before\n          providing any information.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">09</span>Unsolicited email</h2>\n        <p>\n          We do not send unsolicited email messages that could reasonably be\n          considered spam.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">10</span>Change of control</h2>\n        <p>\n          If another company acquires all or substantially all of our\n          assets through a merger, consolidation, asset purchase or similar\n          transaction, we reserve the right to transfer the data in our\n          possession or under our control to the acquiring party, subject\n          to standard confidentiality safeguards.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">11</span>United Kingdom and European Union</h2>\n        <p>\n          Where the UK GDPR, the Data Protection Act 2018 or the EU GDPR\n          apply, NRE Systems acts as a data controller for information\n          collected through its own websites and as a data processor when\n          handling information on behalf of our customers.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          You have the right to access, correct, erase, restrict, object\n          to, or port the personal data we hold about you, and to lodge a\n          complaint with your local supervisory authority. In the United\n          Kingdom this is the Information Commissioner's Office\n          (<a href=\"https://ico.org.uk\">ico.org.uk</a>). To exercise any of\n          these rights, please write to\n          <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#dcafa9acacb3aea89cb2aeb9afa5afa8b9b1aff2bfb3b1\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"dcafa9acacb3aea89cb2aeb9afa5afa8b9b1aff2bfb3b1\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.\n        </p>\n\n        <h2><span class=\"legal__num\">12</span>Contact</h2>\n        <p>\n          If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, the\n          best place to start is email. Please write to\n          <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c7b4b2b7b7a8b5b387a9b5a2b4beb4b3a2aab4e9a4a8aa\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"275452575748555367495542545e5453424a540944484a\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>\n          and we will do our best to respond within one business day.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <aside class=\"aside\">\n      <div class=\"optout-card\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Opt-out</span>\n        <h2 class=\"optout-card__title\">NRE Systems</h2>\n        <p class=\"optout-card__body\">\n          You have the right to exclude this device from personalised\n          advertising delivered through NRE Systems. Click the button below\n          to record your opt-out preference in this browser — the setting\n          applies immediately and persists for up to two years.\n        </p>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"optout-card__btn\" id=\"optout-btn-inline\">\n          <span class=\"optout-card__btn-label\">Opt out</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"aside__meta\">\n        <strong>NRE Systems</strong><br/>\n        <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"5c2f292c2c332e281c322e392f252f2839312f723f3331\">[email&#160;protected]</a><br/>\n        Updated 12 January 2026\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"site-footer__inner\">\n      <span class=\"site-footer__brand\">\n        <span class=\"logo__mark\"></span>\n        © 2026 NRE Systems · All rights reserved\n      </span>\n      <div class=\"site-footer__links\">\n        <a href=\"index.html\">Privacy</a>\n        <a href=\"optout.html\">Opt-out</a>\n        <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#8efdfbfefee1fcfacee0fcebfdf7fdfaebe3fda0ede1e3\">Contact</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script>\n    (function () {\n      var btn = document.getElementById('optout-btn-inline');\n      if (!btn) return;\n      var label = btn.querySelector('.optout-card__btn-label');\n      try {\n        if (localStorage.getItem('nre_optout') === '1') {\n          btn.classList.add('is-done');\n          label.textContent = 'You are opted out';\n          btn.disabled = true;\n        }\n      } catch (e) {}\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        try { localStorage.setItem('nre_optout', '1'); } catch (e) {}\n        btn.classList.add('is-done');\n        label.textContent = 'You are opted out';\n        btn.disabled = true;\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5cc12d6fd7b2d07',t:'MTc5NTA1ODM2OQ=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5cc12d6fd7b2d07',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
